  <activityDataset>
    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="a30e138a-f085-5276-bb00-604aaf6e017a" activityNameId="c76cb0d5-4a75-506d-8343-3ce6ddf31882" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Industrial residual wood, azobe (SFM), u=15%, CM, at sawmill</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Industrial residual wood, azobe (SFM), u=15%, CM, at sawmill
data refers to wood from Central Africa, used in Europe. The multi-output process "sawing an planing, timber, azobe, air dried, u=15%, CM" delivers the two coproducts "sawn timber (SFM), azobe, planed, air dried, u=15%, CM, at sawmill" and "industrial residue wood, azobe (SFM), u=15%, CM, at sawmill". Allocation is based on the over-all proceeds of the process;
UUID: f76db83e-835a-3446-9564-9d78253d3a8b
includes transportation to sawmill by lorry; sawing and plaining of azobe log in 20 mm sawn timber boards; natural drying is assumed; 30% of log input (including sapwood) is generated as co-product that is sold or is used for energy recovery used outside this process.
Location: Wood from Central Africa, sawing in Europe
Technology: Data extrapolated from Meranti window production in the Netherlands. Depending on sawing technology, specific wood density of a particular log and type of sawn timber produced, data may vary
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Technology
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_f76db83e-835a-3446-9564-9d78253d3a8b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="20a9bf48-6cea-59b4-ad08-000cb981f2d0" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
        <shortname xml:lang="en">RER</shortname>
        <comment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Location: Wood from Central Africa, sawing in Europe</text>
        </comment>
